================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
================================================================================

This section covers griffel-femex.Cli, which is the only artefact in this
repository distributed as a binary. It was built from the resolved dependency
graph -- `dotnet list griffel-femex.Cli package --include-transitive`, 82 packages
-- with each licence read from that package's own .nuspec in the local package
cache rather than assumed from its name.

Two projects carry no third-party dependency at all, and that is a property both
were built for rather than an accident: griffel-femex.Reporting has none, because
a report a firm files against a project has to still open in five years and every
dependency is a way for that to stop being true; and the viewer, in the
griffel-femex-viewer repository, is a single self-contained HTML file with no
library, framework or font of any kind.


